/**
 * Phase 8 — an uploaded source file (drawing, schedule, photo, spreadsheet,
 * report, etc.) awaiting or undergoing AI-assisted extraction/inspection
 * processing. Distinct from GeneratedDocument, which is an already-rendered
 * *output* of the platform (a BOQ export). The original upload is never
 * overwritten; derivative artifacts (previews, pages, extracted data,
 * annotations) are stored separately under their own storage-key prefixes.
 */
